---
layout: en-base.njk
title: Be true to yourself
description: Welcome to cerfly's quiet corner of the internet — the things he's learning, building, and thinking about.
nav: home
enUrl: /
zhUrl: /zh/
permalink: /
---
        <section class="hero">
            <h1>Hi, I'm cerfly</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Welcome to my quiet corner of the internet</p>
            <p class="tagline">A place for the things I'm learning, building, and thinking about. Nothing fancy — just honest progress.</p>
            <div class="hero-links">
                <a href="about.html" class="btn">A little about me</a>
                <a href="now.html" class="btn btn-outline">What I'm doing now</a>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="home-section">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Latest posts</h2>
                <div class="line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="blog-posts">
                {%- for post in collections.post | reverse %}
                {%- if loop.index <= 3 %}
                <article class="post-card">
                    <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
                    <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date | dateEn }} &middot; {{ post.data.category }}</p>
                    <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
                    <p><a class="read-more" href="{{ post.url }}">Read more &rarr;</a></p>
                </article>
                {%- endif %}
                {%- endfor %}
            </div>
            <p class="section-more"><a class="read-more" href="/blog.html">View all posts &rarr;</a></p>
        </section>